### Step 1: Create a method to serve video content

You'll need to create a new method in one of your ASP.NET controller classes that will take a video ID or similar identifier, retrieve the video from SQL Server, and return it as a stream.

```csharp
// Controller Method to stream video
public ActionResult StreamVideo(string id)
{
    string constr = "YourConnectionStringHere";

    using (SqlConnection con = new SqlConnection(constr))
    {
